{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120083","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120083/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120083/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120083/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120083","id":4613508277,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEvyMtQ","number":120083,"title":"AnimatableBody2D ignores parent's scale","user":{"login":"prvak","id":2436340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzYzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2436340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak","html_url":"https://github.com/prvak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/prvak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-08T13:56:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T14:20:26Z","closed_at":"2026-06-08T14:18:08Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: v4.6.3.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.3.stable - Linux Mint 22.3 (Zena) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 (nvidia; 570.211.01) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4790K CPU @ 4.00GHz (8 threads) - 15.48 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI am changing position of an AnimatableBody2D using an AnimationPlayer. The only parameter that changes is the \"position\".\n\nWhen I change the \"scale\" of the parent node using a tween, the AnimatableBody2D doesn't resize, its size on the screen remains the same. It actually changes its scale to counter the scale of the parent node.\n\nEverything works fine when I set \"Sync to Physics\" to false or when I stop changing the position.\n\nI would expect that when I change the scale of a parent, all its children scale accordingly. Is this a bug or just an undocumented behavior of Sync to Physics?\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAnimate position of AnimatableBody2D using an AnimationPlayer.\n<img width=\"274\" height=\"136\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f619cd38-cf30-40f8-9cf3-5b01e976acc9\" />\n\nAt the same time, change the scale of the Game node.\n```gdscript\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar tween := create_tween()\n\ttween.tween_property(%Game, ^\"scale\", Vector2.ONE * 0.1, 2.0)\n```\n\nNotice that the Background scales down but the AnimatableBody2D remains the same.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[animatable_body_2d_scale_issue.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28707021/animatable_body_2d_scale_issue.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"prvak","id":2436340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzYzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2436340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url"